        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLNEW, Soleil Rose with Newport Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you are looking that is timelessly elegant with a touch of detail, then the Soleil Rosette with Newport Lever is the perfect leverset for you. Its rope lever and the vivid lines on the rosette bring dynamic boldness to any room. The Newport Lever with Soleil Rose is available in a wide array of popular finish colors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Soleil Rose with Newport Lever will fit most standard pre-drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLNEW Soleil Rosette with Newport Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Soleil Collection Newport Leverset:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLNEW-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262388\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLNEW Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working levers. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Soleil Rosette with Newport Lever",
                "description": "If you are looking that is timelessly elegant with a touch of detail, then the Soleil Rosette with Newport Lever is the perfect leverset for you. Its rope lever and the vivid lines on the rosette bring dynamic boldness to any room. The Newport Lever with Soleil Rose is available in a wide array of popular finish colors. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. The Soleil Rose with Newport Lever will fit most standard pre-drilled doors.",
